id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2024-12-18T21:59:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100583","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100583.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100583.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes #92292\r\n\r\nFor objects with transparency set to depth pre-pass alpha, a depth pre-pass needs to occur before drawing the object for the z-ordering to be correct. The mobile renderer didn't include any depth pre-pass, because tiled rendering doesn't benefit from it like immediate mode rendering does. This PR only adds a depth pre-pass for objects that need it to render properly.\r\n\r\nUnlike in the Forward+ renderer, this depth pre-pass is performed just before the transparent pass. My thought process for this was that any pre-transparent compositor effect shouldn't have to deal with an object in the depth buffer that isn't also present in the color buffer. We can't do anything to prevent that from happening in the Forward+ renderer, but here we can.\r\n\r\nThe depth shader has (but never writes to) a color attachment in order maintain [render pass compatibility](https://docs.vulkan.org/spec/latest/chapters/renderpass.html#renderpass-compatibility), without the need for additional subpasses.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100583/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100583/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}